("The project develops an AI-assisted inverse protein-design system that generates amino-acid) Tj
T* (sequences compatible with a user-specified protein topology. The target protein structure is converted) Tj
T* (into a graph in which residues are represented as nodes and spatial interactions are represented as) Tj
T* (edges. A pretrained ProteinSolver graph neural network predicts suitable amino acids for unknown or) Tj
T* (redesignable residue positions. Multiple candidate sequences are generated, ranked using sequence) Tj
T* (and model-confidence measures, and computationally validated to determine whether they are likely) Tj
T* (to reproduce the required three-dimensional structure.The model was trained using more than 70) Tj
T* (million protein sequences associated with over 80,000 experimentally determined protein structures.") Tj
