("The Attention-Based Compound–Protein Interaction \(CPI\) Prediction for Drug Discovery project) Tj
T* (focuses on developing a deep learning model that predicts whether a chemical compound \(drug) Tj
T* (molecule\) can effectively interact with a target protein. Identifying these interactions is one of the most) Tj
T* (important steps in drug discovery because a drug must bind to a disease-related protein to produce a) Tj
T* (therapeutic effect.                                                                                                                                    ) Tj
T* (                                                                                                                                             The) Tj
T* (proposed attention-based model automatically learns important features from:molecular structures of) Tj
T* (compounds, and amino acid sequences of proteins,to predict whether they interact, thereby reducing) Tj
T* (both cost and development time.                                                                                                             ) Tj
T* (                                                                   ""The attention layer is the core component of the project.) Tj
T* (Instead of treating every atom or amino acid equally, the attention mechanism learns which parts of) Tj
T* (the compound and protein are most important for binding.""") Tj
