(People respond differently to food because of variations in metabolism, blood biomarkers, BMI, age,) Tj
T* (gender, and lifestyle. However, most existing nutrition applications provide general diet plans based) Tj
T* (mainly on calorie intake, height, weight, and BMI, without properly considering an individual’s) Tj
T* (biochemical condition. The base study establishes a relationship between standard blood) Tj
T* (biochemistry, BMI, and dietary patterns using deep neural networks, with important features such as) Tj
T* (ALT, AST, uric acid, glucose, cholesterol, energy intake, fat, sugar, protein, carbohydrates, caffeine,) Tj
T* (and vitamins. However, the study mainly focuses on weight-category classification and dietary-pattern) Tj
T* (analysis rather than generating interactive personalized recommendations. Therefore, BioNutriGPT is) Tj
T* (proposed as an AI-based system that analyses blood biomarkers, BMI, food intake, demographic) Tj
T* (information, and lifestyle factors to predict nutritional and weight-related risks. The system will identify) Tj
T* (the factors influencing each prediction and generate understandable, personalized nutrition) Tj
T* (recommendations in natural language for users and nutrition professionals.) Tj
