(Existing nutrition and food recommendation systems mainly provide calorie tracking and basic dietary) Tj
T* (advice but lack intelligent understanding of food-related knowledge. Current solutions struggle to) Tj
T* (analyze nutritional content, food safety risks, ingredient substitutions, and personalized dietary) Tj
T* (requirements simultaneously. There is a need for an AI-powered system that can understand natural) Tj
T* (language queries and provide context-aware food insights. The proposed FoodInsightAI leverages) Tj
T* (Large Language Models \(LLMs\) to analyze food composition, nutrition, recipes, allergens, and food) Tj
T* (safety information. The system generates personalized dietary recommendations based on user) Tj
T* (preferences, health conditions, and nutritional requirements. It also assists users with recipe) Tj
T* (generation, ingredient substitutions, and food quality awareness. This approach aims to improve) Tj
T* (decision-making, promote healthier eating habits, and enhance food safety through intelligent) Tj
T* (conversational AI.) Tj
