(Intervertebral Disc Degeneration \(IVDD\) is a major cause of chronic low back pain caused by) Tj
T* (inflammation and extracellular matrix \(ECM\) degradation. Current treatment approaches are limited in) Tj
T* (addressing the disease's complex molecular mechanisms. Nutraceutical compounds such as) Tj
T* (curcumin, quercetin, resveratrol, melatonin, and baicalein have shown potential therapeutic effects.) Tj
T* (However, their multitarget interactions with IVDD-associated proteins remain unclear. This study) Tj
T* (integrates molecular docking with network-based analysis to identify key protein interactions and) Tj
T* (biological pathways. The findings provide a computational framework for discovering potential) Tj
T* (therapeutic targets for IVDD.) Tj
