(Poor oral absorption is one of the primary reasons for drug failure during the early stages of drug) Tj
T* (discovery, leading to increased development time and cost. Experimental evaluation of Human) Tj
T* (Intestinal Absorption \(HIA\) and Human Oral Bioavailability \(HOB\) is expensive, time-consuming, and) Tj
T* (resource-intensive. Existing computational methods often suffer from limited datasets, class) Tj
T* (imbalance, and poor interpretability. This project aims to develop an AI-driven framework that predicts) Tj
T* (HIA and HOB directly from molecular structures represented as SMILES strings. The system employs) Tj
T* (machine learning and molecular descriptors to accurately classify orally active compounds before) Tj
T* (synthesis. It also provides feature interpretation using explainable AI techniques and identifies) Tj
T* (important molecular substructures responsible for oral absorption. This approach enables rapid) Tj
T* (screening of drug candidates, reducing experimental costs and accelerating drug discovery.) Tj
